{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41902","headline":"赠朐山孙明府 · 李中","name":"赠朐山孙明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"县庭无事似山斋，满砌青青旋长苔。\n闲抚素琴曹吏散，自烹新茗海僧来。\n买将病鹤劳心养，移得闲花用意栽。\n几度访君留我醉，瓮香皆值酒新开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41902.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41902","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}